{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-28","kind":"proposition","title":"等圆内之直线等则其割本圆之分大与大小与小各等","englishTitle":"In equal circles equal straight lines cut off equal circumferences, the greater equal to the greater and the less to the less.","book":3,"number":28,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":28,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","contentId":"euclid-3-28","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"231b1a72e343eb42e93e9eb5197dc6986abc3e4a0d849c8cb19fb273a7d044b0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-28.statement","euclid-3-28.construction.1","euclid-3-28.construction.2","euclid-3-28.proof.1","euclid-3-28.proof.2","euclid-3-28.proof.3","euclid-3-28.conclusion","euclid-3-28.historical.1","euclid-3-28.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-28.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5eb0ffe2ab6b2434acba2c20fa2dc63d8e1d0a804387a4a993dd82a17b0c9464","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal circles equal straight lines cut off equal circumferences, the greater equal to the greater and the less to the less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在相同的圆圈中,等直线截断等宽,大数量等于大数量,小数量等于小数量。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜内之直线等则其割本圜之分大与大小与小各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在全等圆内的直线相等，则原圆的分割在大小、尺寸和规模上都是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb864178f0f2d74819c82806b9be54559fbf8ed6e11d3f6633dc3eecb83f12a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be equal circles, and in the circles let AB, DE be equal straight lines cutting off ACB, DFE as greater circumferences and AGB, DHE as lesser; I say that the greater circumference ACB is equal to the greater circumference DFE, and the less circumference AGB to DHE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DEF成为平等的圈子,在圈子里让AB,DE成为平等的直线,切断ACB,DFE大环形线,AGB,DHE小径线;我说,ACB大环形线等于更大的DFE大环形线,小径线AGB至DHE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07e1c87906c606532a8db65fc2b85d84d3685cae977fcb111aefe405d1921295","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the centres K, L of the circles be taken, and let AK, KB, DL, LE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"K,L中心被拆掉,AK,KB,DL,LE中心被连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb325e26434221f6d6051df7b01e19f964d7b6c026761ae4de6a175d53a731da","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the circles are equal, the radii are also equal; therefore the two sides AK, KB are equal to the two sides DL, LE; and the base AB is equal to the base DE; therefore the angle AKB is equal to the angle DLE. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于圆圈是平等的,弧形也是平等的;因此,两边AK,KB是平等的,DL,LE;底边,AB等于底边,DE;因此,角AKB等于角DLE。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f25fa10bedd4d74e8deef586d1fe4b8b58a6cc02a70caacf11a0506474066547","citations":["euclid-3-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equal angles stand on equal circumferences, when they are at the centres; [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)] therefore the circumference AGB is equal to DHE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,在中心时,在相同的环形上,角度是相同的;因此,环形AGB等于DHE。 [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bdc7aeb4c8e855c4a628bdd9f2f0d33ebb29b742c61fa388a93cfb265fb982e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the whole circle ABC is also equal to the whole circle DEF; therefore the circumference ACB which remains is also equal to the circumference DFE which remains."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"整个ABC圆也等于整个DEF圆, 因此,ACB圆的长度也等于DFE圆的长度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de3606fdc8075434303c8ac0cce1201304420b169a1035de02bf3505f76fd209","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜内之直线等则其割本圜之分大与大小与小各等解曰甲乙丙丁戊己两圜等其心为庚为辛圜内有甲丙丁己两直线等题言甲乙丙与丁戊己两大分甲丙与丁己两小分各等论曰试于甲庚庚丙丁辛辛己各作直线其甲庚丙角形之甲丙与丁辛己角形之丁己两底既等而甲庚庚丙两腰与丁辛辛己两腰又等即庚辛两角亦等〈一卷八〉其所乘之甲丙丁己两小分必等〈本篇廿六〉次减相等之甲丙丁己两小分则所存甲乙丙丁戊己两大分亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果圆内的直线相等，则原圆的分割在大小、尺寸和规模上分别相等。解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己和两个圆相等，以庚和辛为中心庚6。圆内有两条直线，甲丙丁己和甲丙丁己。命题解释：甲乙丙和丁戊己分成两大部分，甲丙和丁己，每部分相等。证明如下：在甲庚庚丙丁辛辛己、甲丙和丁辛己上画直线，并且丁辛己有相等的底边，甲庚庚丙和丁辛辛己的腰相等，因此庚辛的两个角也相等。〈一卷八〉乘以甲丙丁己必须相等，〈本篇廿六〉减去相等的甲丙丁己子分割，因此甲乙丙丁戊己的两大部分也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-28.source","contentId":"euclid-3-28","revisionId":"euclid-3-28@raw-231b1a72e343eb42","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b11fd5c5564b7d9d9e757ca1ebefae2146d43e2f32a866f60d146a291d2803f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-28:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-28.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"I. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-28:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-28.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"III. 26"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-30:euclid-3-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-30.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"III. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-8:euclid-3-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-8.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"III. 28"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-28:euclid-1-8:explicit","id":"euclid-1-8","book":1,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：三边分别相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-28:euclid-3-26:explicit","id":"euclid-3-26","book":3,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圆分亦等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-30:euclid-3-28:explicit","id":"euclid-3-30","book":3,"number":30,"kind":"proposition","title":"有圆之分求两平分之","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-8:euclid-3-28:explicit","id":"euclid-13-8","book":13,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"正五边形对角线中的黄金分割","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
